{"unit_id":"lovy2004__dsh-molbio-tools#feature-1","repo":"lovy2004/dsh-molbio-tools","commit":"66dff83e71fb83433021f9451b49a894aed280e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-molbio-tools 的功能「PCR 引物设计」：按模板扫描正反向候选并依据 Tm、GC、发夹、自互补和二聚体等条件筛选排序。调用引物设计工具提交序列和扩增子范围，返回候选引物对及其评估指标。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:1091","design.mjs:2"]}
{"unit_id":"lovy2004__dsh-molbio-tools#feature-2","repo":"lovy2004/dsh-molbio-tools","commit":"66dff83e71fb83433021f9451b49a894aed280e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-molbio-tools 的功能「质粒解析与绘图」：读取 SnapGene 或 GenBank 文件，提取序列和注释并生成质粒图谱。用户调用文件解析或 map 工具，可获得解析结果或写入工作区的 SVG 图。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:450","snapgene.mjs:1","genbank.mjs:1","plasmid.mjs:1"]}
{"unit_id":"lovy2004__dsh-molbio-tools#feature-3","repo":"lovy2004/dsh-molbio-tools","commit":"66dff83e71fb83433021f9451b49a894aed280e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-molbio-tools 的功能「克隆模拟」：模拟限制酶切连接或 Gibson 组装，并计算最终质粒序列、连接点及特征坐标。提交载体和插入片段序列后可得到组装结果，并可生成 FASTA 或质粒图谱。","source":"generated","evidence":["cloning.mjs:1","index.mjs:450"]}
